      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there is nobody to reach out to. they're all gone. it's like a wall went up and i'm on the other side of it forever. i look at them and they're all so happy and connected, and then i look at myself and i just feel like a mistake. like i shouldn't have even been part of it in the first place. it just feels so final, you know? like there's no version of my life where this gets better.",
